  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable family planning and reproductive health in Ethiopia  through enhanced social marketing program in the private sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The DKT program intends to increase and sustain the use of modern family planning methods, promote the practice of safe sexual behaviour and reduce the incidence of HIV/AIDS and contribute to the reduction of maternal and child morbidity and mortality. The project increase access to and and use of afforadable and high quality both short and long acting contraceptives, various brands of condoms, medical abortion kits, misoprostol and oral rehydration salts in Ethiopia through social marketing program in the private sector.</narrative>
  </description>
